{"id":404,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"Proudly uses its electrified claws as weapons. It seems to be a gracious Pokémon, evenly sharing the spoils of the hunt with others of its kind."},{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Upon encountering an opponent, this Pokémon prepares for battle by extending its claws, which can put out 1,000,000 volts of electricity."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"By joining its tail with that of another Luxio, this Pokémon can receive some of the other Luxio’s electricity and power up its own electric blasts."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"Strong electricity courses through the tips of its sharp claws. A light scratch causes fainting in foes."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","Diamond"],"text":"Its claws loose electricity with enough amperage to cause fainting. They live in small groups."},{"games":["SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"By gathering their tails together, they collectively generate powerful electricity from their claws."},{"games":["Pearl"],"text":"It rests its forelegs on others to communicate with rhythmic electric pulses from its claws."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Rivalry","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's competitive spirit makes it deal more damage to Pokémon of the same gender, but less damage to Pokémon of the opposite gender."},{"name":"Intimidate","hidden":false,"description":"When the Pokémon enters a battle, it intimidates opposing Pokémon and makes them cower, lowering their Attack stats."},{"name":"Guts","hidden":true,"description":"It's so gutsy that having a status condition boosts the Pokémon's Attack stat."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":100,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":null,"color":"Blue","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":403,"name":"Shinx","condition":null,"children":[{"id":404,"name":"Luxio","condition":"Lv. 15","children":[{"id":405,"name":"Luxray","condition":"Lv. 30","children":[]}]}]},"